{"v":4,"catch":"動物們展開的劍與魔法冒險奇幻遊戲！\n開墾田地，整頓裝備，為了拯救世界展開冒險吧！","desc":"◆ 在動物生活的世界裡展開的冒險！\n故事的舞臺是可愛動物生活的國家《奇塔利亞童話》。\n傭兵主角「喵薩」一行負責保護周圍怪物猖獗的肉球村。\n究竟怪物們為什麼會變得如此殘暴呢？\n喵薩一行為了查明真相開始了旅程。\n\n◆ 在村裡開墾田地前往冒險吧！\n喵薩會前往各種地方冒險。\n能與兇殘的怪物戰鬥並達成委託，\n也能在自己的田裡自由耕種。\n吃下用自己種植的農作物做成的料理時，\n能力值會暫時上升！\n徹底準備好，讓冒險順利進行！","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["角色扮演","冒險","動作","模擬"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 2.7GB / Switch 2.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/af127668dd4ea6c8ddaf8e5ac74a76d7e09effa9f6e432b6f96705f9ca8fdd89.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/66a92e0e9a60b845767cc423bb4785ee0a1052105e7f209fae0385753701ae5b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb2ad041c75a9594e0dc9857adbccb41431e6ae4af870b758cae8acdd66b7f19.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/040958ea1ecf8396991dec73ae484185128f3572f5e31d31b9efb9374204278d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/30b4fce9828cd6c3a516bf14f65f59355df2404d42a189f5c1abca6196492863.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/922d6dcfe2436e6d4314843be8b711f22e07a19e596c3e86cb717d9620289c01.jpg"],"titleId":"010026e015096000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000036182","name":"萬聖節套組","img":"355daa54b182c11cae1136c3e5926abfb573009a648c997f40ca01f137477bce","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000029681","name":"櫻花服裝","img":"b5065b9fc187b5cd7c5d1c9f9e6c771d33f39209b20314f11d3384f79de5c22d","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000029682","name":"冷颼颼服裝","img":"2da48e8b5dd4cc3b12638ba6f6c1cacc665f396f4cb74816f7ceb07b434e19cd","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000029683","name":"惡魔貓服裝","img":"2791d3d7b40d20cbccf047e64bccf586cd0ff64d0bd2ff0044867d7f7d8c2e0e","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000029684","name":"異國風造型雙重套裝","img":"d9be5cf657cf7c8faed52149e6a5287866cdaa9dee8a53632635b4efce760d0d","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"